Package: omaxian-calamares-settings
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, calamares, omaxian-branding, pkexec, rsync
Description: Calamares configuration for Omaxian OS live media
 sysvinit-aware module sequence (shellprocess + update-rc.d instead of
 services-systemd), removal of the live packages after install, GRUB for UEFI
 and BIOS, the Omaxian branding and an "Install Omaxian OS" launcher.
